---
title: Chat with my AI bot
description: Ask my AI bot about me, my work, week notes and unconferences.
---
<p>It's read my website, so you can ask it about me, my work, week notes and unconferences - or anything else.</p>
<p class="hint">The AI's not me and can get things wrong. To reach me, use the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>

<div id="chat-log" class="chat-log" role="log" aria-live="polite" aria-label="Conversation"></div>

<form id="chat-form" class="chat-form">
  <label for="chat-input">Your message</label>
  <textarea id="chat-input" rows="3" maxlength="2000" required></textarea>
  <div class="row">
    <button type="submit" id="chat-send">Send</button>
    <button type="button" id="chat-reset" class="secondary">Start again</button>
    <span id="chat-status" class="hint" role="status"></span>
  </div>
</form>
<noscript><p>This page needs JavaScript to work.</p></noscript>
<script src="{{ '/assets/js/chat.js' | versioned }}" defer></script>
